  "problem": "Duration::MAX was accepted by public CacheOptions. Successful bounded count/body consumption then panicked on unchecked Instant addition while holding the cache mutex; identical second call panicked on the poisoned mutex. On this actual host, exact u64MAX milliseconds was representable and both APIs cached successfully.",
